@page "/anyapp"
<PageTitle>AnyApp: The Local Host</PageTitle>

<h1>Experience: The Local Host</h1>

<p>
    An "Experience" is anything that presents one or more sensory outputs (e.g., a game, an interactive
    tool, a simulation). The Experience layer is the local application that consumes the FSM Layer
    micro-packages to host and run the defined FSM behaviors. It is the runtime composition layer.
</p>

<h2>Key Role</h2>
<p>
    AnyApp consumes the FSM Layer to host locally what we call an "Experience," providing the
    runtime environment and necessary external service integrations.
</p>